      "id": "claim_561dc2e95adc43c2aa3292076e2b0603",
      "statement": "ModelFormatTypeConverter is a Spring @Component Converter<String, ModelFormat> that maps the inputArchitectureModelFormat request parameter to the ArDoCo ModelFormat enum via ModelFormat.valueOf, throwing IllegalArgumentException(\"Invalid architecture model type: ...\") for unknown values; WebConfig registers it as a Spring MVC converter, so an unknown format surfaces as a 422 error body.",
