      "id": "claim_5a1dc2a2938446dc8267298a6220ea5c",
      "statement": "The runner's required output directory is a throwaway temp directory created per request via Files.createTempDirectory with a per-family prefix (ardoco-sad-code, ardoco-sam-code, ardoco-sad-sam, ardoco-sad-sam-code, ardoco-id); the REST layer never reads from it because results are returned via the API response entity, and the input files are likewise temp files deleted in the runPipelineAsync finally block.",
