          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8b2776c431f8e53f4f2bd7cdde211d7ced087402f56b06fce57b21a876f25156:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b00118f5b0454d178b20ff36b8667062",
      "statement": "GET /api/configuration returns ArDoCo's default configuration as a Map<String, String> produced entirely by reflection in ConfigurationProviderService: it scans the edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco package space with org.reflections, keeps non-abstract AbstractConfigurable subclasses outside test packages, instantiates each via ConfigurationInstantiatorUtils.createObject, and collects every @Configurable field's key (AbstractConfigurable.getKeyOfField) and default value in a TreeMap — a duplicate key logs a warning and the last entry wins.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/controller/ConfigurationProviderController.java#L20-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bac380e9d9ffbe3e8dc1261c0205f107adac2f87474c1bffe92bd353758b8fa5:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/service/ConfigurationProviderService.java#L48-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a941f270c016283d690d6e34b654fe352e92786fadecf3dfce6b5be66fdc0b0:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/service/ConfigurationProviderService.java#L63-L102",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dfb745c9f62c1db6c21e6633defa6186769753cc068b812c8e5c0d5db93919eb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4225c0b1410d4ae9b1d0df26252967f9",
      "statement": "The /api/configuration response is a discovery contract for clients: the returned map is exactly the set of additionalConfigs keys the ArDoCo libraries accept, so clients can fetch it and feed any subset back as additionalConfigs. Because the scan is reflection-based, the endpoint automatically tracks new ArDoCo versions; the scan instantiates every configurable class in the ArDoCo codebase on every request, so it is not a high-frequency polling target.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/controller/AbstractController.java#L138-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3fce88f4ea8887c0a541f96c83b0d0c283e70c72dfc6ff6d9c93c1a7eb6fb50b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/service/ConfigurationProviderService.java#L84-L102",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:afce2c04a3ec71d9299a76f327a61bd3ac4149e2cf6aceb4734712e3cf7b7353:"
        }
      ]
    },
