      "statement": "The runner integration is pinned by integration tests against a live Redis container (redis:7.0-alpine via Testcontainers): AbstractTLRControllerTest and its four subclasses exercise the full start → poll → retrieve flow with real bigBlueButton project artifacts (bigbluebutton.txt, codeModel.acm, bbb.repository for PCM, bbb.uml for UML), exercising the actual ModelFormat binding and ArDoCo runner setup rather than mocked runners; the sad-sam and sad-sam-code tests pin both ModelFormat.UML and ModelFormat.PCM, and the sad-code test covers the runner whose setUp takes only text + code.",
